 "Daliani_CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateHero.png", "id": "975740844843565", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819239_975740848176898_614160356923714657_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4cpDCIYbm4QQ7kNvwEQVMen&_nc_oc=Adrwvo34C0Qir8VK65lpdiRB8ymRRa14YM0AKEZOHK0uLXzi_j_5ygPVke5HozlvuVc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8lkwZpiOUMEvhnOETb6up0PXiaMmBXDqasUoHHSqXeAw&oe=6A37F58A"}, {"file_name": "Daliani Icon v5.png", "id": "973386741839825", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823812_973386745173158_2197407544904841183_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qoc9VG3D-3gQ7kNvwG9cDoB&_nc_oc=Adoo9XxGNyf8M5OkW1RVVjaLZwTWpOLu7LAL6tLQ5z9HIC6sWqvPHxY-LLJc0sOIyio&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9Rc5eM8hRIwvAhL4qLlNRpXFTNCS08M7KL5YiWNoH-jw&oe=6A37E29F"}]}, "id": "1525119779239018", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "com.Dotsoft.Daliani-20260505-151821 copy.png", "id": "971781582104951", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823930_971781585438284_8408649887222969230_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NMwOANNNp9sQ7kNvwHTDmyR&_nc_oc=AdrLIkz5_fpABbu25I_6J0M3k-sxwaBrMJBboP89l4YjPGktTSMutUS0F8V9f20ZsPM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9va5rMTtAwOAmHAtfnGFPRy028JqAHusZBuIhj52zsVw&oe=6A37E618"}, {"file_name": "com.Dotsoft.Daliani-20260505-152006.png", "id": "1007960685001694", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624700_1007960688335027_8508758570384968444_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kIl1gDC32c8Q7kNvwFwP6VX&_nc_oc=AdqqZUe_Xs689D5bBbrpeBXaqS08wZSBJL-MYU86wJUFJVLUkQ6byVLVJ7IEw5Ltvoo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8GIShsVKl3HHpQGhj8x6Kb7VqfNvzApakWs-2oBrKadw&oe=6A37F6E6"}, {"file_name": "com.Dotsoft.Daliani-20260505-152154.png", "id": "1259224769624969", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830467_1259224772958302_5944639226009981632_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=k3jcZVdhLOIQ7kNvwHeLU_T&_nc_oc=Adq5YuSrQLPNBOoBSFz58UIP86hwDRV3p52yNxDy77EI91aVqj-A8Bf9fFiAcELMklM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9L124zXnGoSsC1k5o_fbTFSCXc7M7ERkf6Ixu8NhAqwg&oe=6A37DDF5"}, {"file_name": "com.Dotsoft.Daliani-20260505-152135.png", "id": "943990228508203", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819859_943990231841536_5409489005583405348_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b4shB4Z1KXsQ7kNvwEmuOau&_nc_oc=AdqxswMoYjQuYqAi6p5MLE8Ur3XliNRplPe9zLbo6uESrqAAxxdGMmxKJN7w20bNTSY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_4vLOnZZttaE1n-3wxyLcOPYqUqDNx2wlcBAyR82FTgQ&oe=6A37F3C0"}, {"file_name": "com.Dotsoft.Daliani-20260505-152145.png", "id": "1459990641994438", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823905_1459990645327771_3687014525619409846_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W0z40mUGkU0Q7kNvwHI0gqz&_nc_oc=AdqwvV0zECGEsSv3Z7gwKWy1yQuQiF8qABiNJcKidzmr3ge_CXH4mO2wUjoPxb0fzzU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-kiwoacbh0pVH9OJPG-H0kLBgDPIVqV1tSFXo8asqBxg&oe=6A37ECB0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Daliani: Living Tradition", "keywords": ["heritage", "fishing", "game", "narrative", "story"], "long_description": "In Daliani: Living Tradition, you become Apostolis, a 17-year-old visiting his uncle Petros at a traditional fishing installation in Preveza for the first time.\n\nFrom the viewpoint on the tower, you listen to local fishermen, answer dialogue prompts, and learn how the net, winches, timing, and observation shape the Daliani fishing method. Use the mechanisms to prepare the trap, watch fish move through the water, and choose the right moment to close the net, to ensure the most successful catch.\n\nBlending guided storytelling, challenge, and cultural heritage, this VR experience introduces players to a rare fishing tradition of the Ambracian Gulf.", "short_description": "Step onto a tower in the Ambracian Gulf and learn the traditional Ntaliani fishing technique through an interactive VR story."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Daliani Icon v5.png", "id": "2209404989875952", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823783_2209404993209285_757507465839310618_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ER7zU0fPdUAQ7kNvwHKIOIV&_nc_oc=Adq2U_fuYZj7qcSWkSqaHaoe5mc_Q702I0UTQCqZVHPL_SwMJjbnR7C9f4u3t-boUXo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9GaKPwBNq4450KYnB_8oL2pI1TIwJutAxMFcunM2tESA&oe=6A37F004"}, {"file_name": "Daliani_CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateHero_gr.png", "id": "2189045815203185", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823270_2189045818536518_1197449426069608052_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pL8RtkbqONsQ7kNvwHBVQ2r&_nc_oc=AdplnkNTiJG83ybCL2ehwuxexc9w4_mJeau3xZWIgtydJYM_5PCVDu4X7ObkVGZPLik&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8fhYxKXwZi88HXuh9iXtsdBBJ0q-_JhOPYMkFjqwigPw&oe=6A37FB73"}, {"file_name": "Daliani_CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_gr.png", "id": "1772726590372627", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819239_1772726593705960_4264978315132988550_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IBZkaf9sEqUQ7kNvwFXLa91&_nc_oc=Adr7O0q9RffL18Z4egTnJQBKNq7wdMAeOTJivrs2pne0mTEuz87wf8DQmdNoNTpgAtg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_XcWSu_W-Fs8OvaMxGMs1h0J9fFj-LONFsC_2XbP_K6Q&oe=6A38047F"}, {"file_name": "Daliani_CoverImageSafeAreaTemplatePortrait_gr.png", "id": "1583897133145655", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818849_1583897136478988_5796830830848411987_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6wLmlfCqtDoQ7kNvwG-ooTN&_nc_oc=AdrpLL_iiBUVnzH8v8BC0rQNigcNtjQBcpMGba_XLH_UTNHscFZa0dJk0p4B5c2M854&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_d5qs-5AOsc__jsRzXguxxVOQD4plQTneuYtYkAIxSWQ&oe=6A37F2E0"}, {"file_name": "Daliani_CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateSquare_gr.png", "id": "1546951613721263", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820141_1546951617054596_8071610752796397453_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UZQJn2u9l6UQ7kNvwEVufgK&_nc_oc=Adpwbyd4J4PflOt5_lMpbcYfmcFFrqLDQ_sSVJqCNhRE9_vRDe6bFAyhz1l7kJkUxGA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-q-fGaPiOQZOZKsmnwBYTMRVW6CTBA9elLZv6bPBl0nw&oe=6A37E6AD"}]}, "id": "983462414367070", "locale": "el_GR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "\u039d\u03c4\u03b1\u03bb\u03b9\u03ac\u03bd\u03b9: \u0396\u03c9\u03bd\u03c4\u03b1\u03bd\u03ae \u03a0\u03b1\u03c1\u03ac\u03b4\u03bf\u03c3\u03b7", "keywords": ["\u03a0\u03b1\u03c1\u03ac\u03b4\u03bf\u03c3\u03b7", "\u03a8\u03ac\u03c1\u03b5\u03bc\u03b1", "\u03a0\u03b1\u03b9\u03c7\u03bd\u03af\u03b4\u03b9", "\u0391\u03c6\u03ae\u03b3\u03b7\u03c3\u03b7", "\u0399\u03c3\u03c4\u03bf\u03c1\u03af\u03b1"], "long_description": "\u03a3\u03c4\u03bf \u039d\u03c4\u03b1\u03bb\u03b9\u03ac\u03bd\u03b9: \u0396\u03c9\u03bd\u03c4\u03b1\u03bd\u03ae \u03a0\u03b1\u03c1\u03ac\u03b4\u03bf\u03c3\u03b7, \u03b1\u03bd\u03b1\u03bb\u03b1\u03bc\u03b2\u03ac\u03bd\u03b5\u03b9\u03c2 \u03c4\u03bf\u03bd \u03c1\u03cc\u03bb\u03bf \u03c4\u03bf\u03c5 \u0391\u03c0\u03bf\u03c3\u03c4\u03cc\u03bb\u03b7, \u03b5\u03bd\u03cc\u03c2 17\u03c7\u03c1\u03bf\u03bd\u03bf\u03c5 \u03c0\u03bf\u03c5 \u03b5\u03c0\u03b9\u03c3\u03ba\u03ad\u03c0\u03c4\u03b5\u03c4\u03b1\u03b9 \u03b3\u03b9\u03b1 \u03c0\u03c1\u03ce\u03c4\u03b7 \u03c6\u03bf\u03c1\u03ac \u03c4\u03bf \u03bd\u03c4\u03b1\u03bb\u03b9\u03ac\u03bd\u03b9 \u03c4\u03bf\u03c5 \u03b8\u03b5\u03af\u03bf\u03c5 \u03c4\u03bf\u03c5 \u03a0\u03ad\u03c4\u03c1\u03bf\u03c5 \u03c3\u03c4\u03b7\u03bd \u03a0\u03c1\u03ad\u03b2\u03b5\u03b6\u03b1.\n\n\u0391\u03c0\u03cc \u03c4\u03bf\u03bd \u03c0\u03cd\u03c1\u03b3\u03bf, \u03b1\u03ba\u03bf\u03cd\u03c2 \u03c4\u03bf\u03c5\u03c2 \u03c8\u03b1\u03c1\u03ac\u03b4\u03b5\u03c2, \u03b5\u03bc\u03c0\u03bb\u03ad\u03ba\u03b5\u03c3\u03b1\u03b9 \u03c3\u03b5 \u03b4\u03b9\u03b1\u03bb\u03cc\u03b3\u03bf\u03c5\u03c2 \u03ba\u03b1\u03b9 \u03bc\u03b1\u03b8\u03b1\u03af\u03bd\u03b5\u03b9\u03c2 \u03c0\u03ce\u03c2 \u03c4\u03bf \u03b4\u03af\u03c7\u03c4\u03c5, \u03b7 \u03c0\u03b1\u03c1\u03b1\u03c4\u03ae\u03c1\u03b7\u03c3\u03b7 \u03ba\u03b1\u03b9 \u03c4\u03bf \u03c3\u03c9\u03c3\u03c4\u03cc timing \u03c3\u03c5\u03bd\u03b8\u03ad\u03c4\u03bf\u03c5\u03bd \u03c4\u03b7\u03bd \u03c4\u03b5\u03c7\u03bd\u03b9\u03ba\u03ae \u03c4\u03bf\u03c5 \u03bd\u03c4\u03b1\u03bb\u03b9\u03ac\u03bd\u03b9. \u03a7\u03b5\u03b9\u03c1\u03af\u03c3\u03bf\u03c5 \u03c4\u03bf\u03c5\u03c2 \u03bc\u03b7\u03c7\u03b1\u03bd\u03b9\u03c3\u03bc\u03bf\u03cd\u03c2, \u03c0\u03b1\u03c1\u03b1\u03ba\u03bf\u03bb\u03bf\u03cd\u03b8\u03b7\u03c3\u03b5 \u03c4\u03b1 \u03ba\u03bf\u03c0\u03ac\u03b4\u03b9\u03b1 \u03c8\u03b1\u03c1\u03b9\u03ce\u03bd \u03ba\u03b1\u03b9 \u03b4\u03b9\u03ac\u03bb\u03b5\u03be\u03b5 \u03c4\u03b7 \u03c3\u03c9\u03c3\u03c4\u03ae \u03c3\u03c4\u03b9\u03b3\u03bc\u03ae \u03b3\u03b9\u03b1 \u03bd\u03b1 \u03ba\u03bb\u03b5\u03af\u03c3\u03b5\u03b9\u03c2 \u03c4\u03b7\u03bd \u03c0\u03b1\u03b3\u03af\u03b4\u03b1, \u03ce\u03c3\u03c4\u03b5 \u03bd\u03b1 \u03b5\u03c0\u03b9\u03c4\u03cd\u03c7\u03b5\u03b9\u03c2 \u03c4\u03b7 \u03bc\u03ad\u03b3\u03b7\u03c3\u03c4\u03b7 \u03c8\u03b1\u03c1\u03b9\u03ac!\n\n\u039c\u03b9\u03b1 \u03c3\u03cd\u03bd\u03c4\u03bf\u03bc\u03b7 VR \u03b5\u03bc\u03c0\u03b5\u03b9\u03c1\u03af\u03b1 \u03c0\u03bf\u03c5 \u03c3\u03c5\u03bd\u03b4\u03c5\u03ac\u03b6\u03b5\u03b9 \u03b1\u03c6\u03ae\u03b3\u03b7\u03c3\u03b7, \u03c0\u03c1\u03cc\u03ba\u03bb\u03b7\u03c3\u03b7 \u03ba\u03b1\u03b9 \u03c0\u03bf\u03bb\u03b9\u03c4\u03b9\u03c3\u03c4\u03b9\u03ba\u03ae \u03ba\u03bb\u03b7\u03c1\u03bf\u03bd\u03bf\u03bc\u03b9\u03ac, \u03b6\u03c9\u03bd\u03c4\u03b1\u03bd\u03b5\u03cd\u03bf\u03bd\u03c4\u03b1\u03c2 \u03c4\u03b7 \u03c3\u03c0\u03ac\u03bd\u03b9\u03b1 \u03b1\u03bb\u03b9\u03b5\u03c5\u03c4\u03b9\u03ba\u03ae \u03c0\u03b1\u03c1\u03ac\u03b4\u03bf\u03c3\u03b7 \u03c4\u03bf\u03c5 \u0391\u03bc\u03b2\u03c1\u03b1\u03ba\u03b9\u03ba\u03bf\u03cd \u039a\u03cc\u03bb\u03c0\u03bf\u03c5.", "short_description": "\u0391\u03c0\u03cc \u03c4\u03bf\u03bd \u03c0\u03cd\u03c1\u03b3\u03bf \u03c4\u03bf\u03c5 \u039d\u03c4\u03b1\u03bb\u03b9\u03ac\u03bd\u03b9 \u03c3\u03c4\u03bf\u03bd \u0391\u03bc\u03b2\u03c1\u03b1\u03ba\u03b9\u03ba\u03cc \u03b3\u03bd\u03ce\u03c1\u03b9\u03c3\u03b5 \u03c4\u03b7\u03bd \u03c0\u03b1\u03c1\u03b1\u03b4\u03bf\u03c3\u03b9\u03b1\u03ba\u03ae \u03c4\u03b5\u03c7\u03bd\u03b9\u03ba\u03ae \u03bd\u03c4\u03b1\u03bb\u03b9\u03ac\u03bd\u03b9 \u03bc\u03ad\u03c3\u03b1 \u03b1\u03c0\u03cc \u03bc\u03b9\u03b1 \u03b4\u03b9\u03b1\u03b4\u03c1\u03b1\u03c3\u03c4\u03b9\u03ba\u03ae VR \u03b9\u03c3\u03c4\u03bf\u03c1\u03af\u03b1."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://dotsoft.gr/en/privacy-policy-app-daliani-living-tradition", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "DOTSOFT SA", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://dotsoft.gr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1008279844328894"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in